/*
 * Declares the DeferredClassType class.
 *
 * A DeferredClassType is the temporary type of the construction of a template
 * class whose constructor leaves some of the template parameters of the class
 * unresolved. Their solving is deferred to the first method call on the
 * constructed value, the construction being then validated on the inferred
 * specialization.
 *
 * DeferredClassType is a temporary type: it is never emitted into YIL.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::type::temporary::deferred
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/type/temporary/deferred.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-20
